/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is not connected to your headphones. Make sure they are turned on and near your phone." = "VoiceVista er i øjeblikket ikke forbundet til dine hovedtelefoner. Sørg for, at dine hovedtelefoner er tændte og i nærheden af din telefon.";

/* general.error.heading */
"VoiceVista is not sure which direction you are facing. Hold your phone flat or begin walking, then try again." = "VoiceVista kan ikke afgøre, hvilken retning du vender. Hold telefonen vandret, eller begynd at gå, og prøv igen.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is offline. Some features are limited." = "Ingen internetforbindelse; nogle funktioner er begrænset i offlinetilstand.";

/* devices.callouts.check_audio.airpods.disconnected */
