/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is updating the map data. Try again later." = "VoiceVista opdaterer i øjeblikket kortdataene. Prøv igen senere.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista saves complete snapshots of your markers and routes in separate backup files whenever you add or remove a marker or route. You can restore these backups if iCloud synchronization causes data loss." = "Komplette snapshots af markører og ruter gemmes i separate backupfiler, når du tilføjer eller fjerner dem. Du kan gendanne disse sikkerhedskopier, hvis dine iCloud-data går tabt på grund af synkroniseringsproblemer.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista stores map data to reduce mobile data and battery use. After you clear it, VoiceVista must download the map data again." = "VoiceVista gemmer kortdata for at reducere data og batteriforbrug. Sletning af gemte kortdata kræver, at VoiceVista downloader dataene igen.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista syncs markers and routes between devices through iCloud. If you encounter a sync issue, you can reset this synced data." = "VoiceVista synkroniserer markører og ruter mellem enheder via iCloud. Hvis der opstår et synkroniseringsproblem, kan du nulstille disse synkroniserede data.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista warns you when GPS accuracy exceeds the selected threshold. Lower values require greater accuracy." = "Advar brugeren, når GPS-nøjagtigheden overstiger den definerede tærskel (lavere værdier angiver højere nøjagtighed).";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
