/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can now explore virtual locations by teleporting between intersections and places." = "Du kan nu udforske virtuelle placeringer ved at teleportere mellem kryds og steder.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can select waypoints from your markers." = "Du kan vælge mærker fra din liste over markører.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can teleport between nearby intersections and places to understand their relative distances." = "Du kan teleportere mellem nærliggende kryds og steder for at udforske deres afstandsforhold.";

