/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Your headphones are connected to VoiceVista, but they must be calibrated before use. VoiceVista will let you know whenever calibration is needed, such as each time you turn them on." = "Der blev oprettet forbindelse fra dine hovedtelefoner til VoiceVista, men de skal kalibreres før brug. VoiceVista giver dig besked, hvis der er behov for kalibrering af hovedtelefoner, f.eks. hver gang du tænder for programmet.";

